        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Dr. Karni Singh Shooting Range, New Delhi, Delhi, India\n- Events: 1982 Asian Games, 2010 Commonwealth Games\n- Topics: shooting ranges, sports records\n\nFacts:\n- The 9th Asian Games were held in Delhi, India, from November 19, 1982, to December 4, 1982.\n- The 1982 Asian Games saw 74 Asian and Asian Games records broken.\n- Dr. Karni Singh Shooting Range is a shooting range in New Delhi.\n- Dr. Karni Singh Shooting Range was first constructed for the 1982 Asian Games in New Delhi.\n- Dr. Karni Singh Shooting Range was later rebuilt altogether for the 2010 Commonwealth Games.",
